## ۳. تب‌ها (Tabs)

### نمونه‌ی کد در زبان‌های مختلف

@tabs
@tab "Python"
```python
def hello(name):
    print(f"Hello, {name}!")
    return True

hello("Markup+")
```
@end

@tab "JavaScript"
```javascript
function hello(name) {
    console.log(`Hello, ${name}!`);
    return true;
}

hello("Markup+");
```
@end

@tab "Bash"
```bash
echo "Hello, Markup+!"
echo "Version: 0.6.0"
```
@end

@tab "Python + Flask"
```python
from flask import Flask

app = Flask(__name__)

@app.route("/")
def index():
    return "Hello from Markup+!"
```
@end
@end

